  "model_type": "qwen4_exp",
  "about": "Qwen3.8-Flash-Next on turboderp's EXL3 3.05bpw_h5_ng5 pack (exllamav3 1.4.4, mul1) -- the weights TensorFold 0.6.6 serves (L288 apples-to-apples profile): routed experts EXL3 K3 split gate / up, dense Linears and the shared expert K5, the QSA indexer K3, the MTP drafter from the pack (attention + shared expert K5, experts K3 split, indexer K3), byte copies of the pack. What pulsar has no arm for stays as td405: lm_head BF16 (the pack's K5 head is not read -- the lane builds its MXFP8 head and the MTP draft head from bf16 rows), PLE key / value + GR low-rank + DeltaNet a/b MXFP8 (the pack leaves them F16), norms / router / gates / embed / mixers BF16 from HF, the MTP fc_embedding / fc_hidden MXFP8 from HF (the pack has them K4; the MTP combine reads mxfp8_lt only), the n-gram rows from the HF table (ple_rows; the pack's 3-bit trellis table is not read). Pass --exl3 <the pack>.",
